{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1665","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1665","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1665\",\"parent_revision\":\"ff197c2d77c91b3b4d1537815b7f133d55babf90d6ba1330739121d8fc3248e2\",\"root_revision\":\"ff197c2d77c91b3b4d1537815b7f133d55babf90d6ba1330739121d8fc3248e2\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThree confirmed root causes, all traced to an incomplete rollout of the SAM server consolidation from 8 tools to 3:\\n\\n**RC1 \u2014 Cache/source divergence:** The source (`plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/server.py`) was already refactored to register only 3 tools (`sam_plan`, `sam_task`, `sam_active_task`). The plugin cache (version 6.5.3) still serves all 11 tools (8 deprecated + 3 new). Agents load from cache. The fix is a version bump to trigger cache regeneration on next session restart.\\n\\n**RC2 \u2014 `tasks_yaml` description missing enum values:** `CreatePlanConfig.tasks_yaml` field description does not list valid values for `id` (format: `T1`, not `task:`), `complexity` (low | medium | high), `priority` (1=CRITICAL through 5=LOWEST), or `status` (not-started for new tasks). Agents guess field names and values, causing 2\u20134 Pydantic validation retry cycles.\\n\\n**RC3 \u2014 Skills/agents reference deprecated tool names:** 15+ source-tree skill and agent files call `sam_create`, `sam_claim`, `sam_read`, `sam_list`, `sam_state`, `sam_ready`, `sam_update`, `sam_status`. These produce `ToolError: tool not found` at runtime, with 2\u20133 wasted turns per occurrence.\\n\\n## Issue Classification\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**Type**: defect \u00d7 3 \u2014 incomplete rollout: server consolidation not propagated to cache, descriptions, or calling code\\n</div>\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**RC1:**\\n- `plugins/development-harness/.claude-plugin/plugin.json` \u2014 version bump (triggers cache regeneration)\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/server.py` \u2014 confirm 3-tool registration (already done in source)\\n- `tests_sam/test_server_mcp.py` lines 80\u201394 \u2014 update tool count assertion to 3\\n\\n**RC2:**\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/action_models.py` lines 144\u2013154 \u2014 update `CreatePlanConfig.tasks_yaml` Field description with enum values and example\\n\\n**RC3 (15+ files to update):**\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/complete-implementation/SKILL.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/task-decomposition/SKILL.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/add-new-feature/SKILL.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/work-backlog-item/references/step-procedures.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/start-task/SKILL.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/SKILL.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/work-milestone/references/worktree-worker-protocol.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/agents/task-worker.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/agents/swarm-task-planner.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/agents/codebase-analyzer.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/agents/ecosystem-researcher.md`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/agents/feature-researcher.md`\\n</div>\\n\\n## Impact\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**Affected skill and agent files (RC3) \u2014 confirmed in source tree:**\\n\\nSkills calling `sam_create`:\\n- `skills/complete-implementation/SKILL.md` (lines 154, 418)\\n- `skills/task-decomposition/SKILL.md`\\n- `skills/add-new-feature/SKILL.md`\\n- `skills/work-backlog-item/references/step-procedures.md`\\n\\nSkills calling `sam_claim`:\\n- `skills/start-task/SKILL.md`\\n- `skills/implementation-manager/SKILL.md`\\n- `skills/work-milestone/references/worktree-worker-protocol.md`\\n\\nAgents calling deprecated tools (frontmatter `tools:` + body):\\n- `agents/task-worker.md` \u2014 `sam_read`, `sam_claim`\\n- `agents/swarm-task-planner.md` \u2014 `sam_create`\\n- `agents/codebase-analyzer.md` \u2014 `sam_create`\\n- `agents/ecosystem-researcher.md` \u2014 `sam_create`\\n- `agents/feature-researcher.md` \u2014 `sam_create`\\n</div>\\n\\n## Priority\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**P1** \u2014 token waste in every SAM session. Conservative estimate: 5 retry cycles \u00d7 500\u20132,000 tokens = **2,500\u201310,000 tokens wasted per session**. Every agent touching plan creation or task claiming is affected.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**AC1 \u2014 Cache/source divergence resolved:**\\n- [ ] `fastmcp list` against SAM server returns exactly 3 tools: `sam_plan`, `sam_task`, `sam_active_task`\\n- [ ] Calling `sam_create` or `sam_claim` via MCP returns `ToolError` (not a success response)\\n- [ ] `test_server_mcp.py` tool list assertion contains only the 3 new tool names\\n- [ ] Plugin version bumped; session restart propagates fix to cache\\n\\n**AC2 \u2014 `tasks_yaml` description fixed:**\\n- [ ] `CreatePlanConfig.tasks_yaml` field description states: `id` format is `T1`/`T2` (not `task:`), `complexity` valid values (low | medium | high), `priority` 1\u20135 mapping, `status: not-started` for new tasks, plus a minimal 2-task inline YAML example\\n- [ ] An agent given only the parameter description can construct valid `tasks_yaml` without trial-and-error guessing\\n\\n**AC3 \u2014 Skills/agents updated:**\\n- [ ] No grep match for `sam_create|sam_claim|sam_read|sam_list|sam_ready|sam_status|sam_update|sam_state` in source-tree skill and agent files (historical docs in `docs/plans/` exempted)\\n- [ ] All agent frontmatter `tools:` entries updated to `sam_plan`, `sam_task`, `sam_active_task`\\n</div>\\n\\n## Effort\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n| RC | Estimate |\\n|---|---|\\n| RC1: Version bump + test update | XS (&lt;1 hr); redirect stubs = S (2\u20134 hrs) |\\n| RC2: `tasks_yaml` description | XS (30 min) |\\n| RC3: 15-file skills/agents sweep | M (4\u20138 hrs with lint verification) |\\n\\n**Total: S\u2013M** (1\u20132 days)\\n</div>\\n\\n## Reproducibility\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**RC1:** Start a session with version 6.5.3 cached. Call `sam_create` \u2192 success (deprecated tool still registered). Call `sam_plan` \u2192 also success. Two APIs for the same operation.\\n\\n**RC2:** Call `sam_plan` to create a plan with `complexity: M` \u2192 Pydantic validation error. Call again with `complexity: medium` \u2192 success. Agent must discover valid values by trial and error.\\n\\n**RC3:** Load `skills/complete-implementation/SKILL.md` (contains `mcp__plugin_dh_sam__sam_create`). Call `sam_create` against the 3-tool server \u2192 `ToolError: tool not found`.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using SAM MCP tools in agent workflows**, I want **deprecated SAM tools removed from the served interface and skills/agents updated to reference the new tool names** so that **agents do not waste 2,500\u201310,000 tokens per session on retry cycles caused by stale tool names**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: User observation \u2014 transcripts from sessions working on #996 and #1664 (2026-04-08)\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-04-08\\n- **Groomed**: 2026-04-09\\n</div>\\n\\n## Root-Cause Analysis\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**RC1 (5-Whys):**\\n1. Cache serves 11-tool interface (deprecated + new)\\n2. Server source was consolidated but version not bumped to force cache invalidation\\n3. No session restart was performed after consolidation\\n4. Agents load from cache (`/root/.claude/plugins/cache/\u2026/6.5.3/`) \u2014 not from source\\n5. Cache version 6.5.3 is stale\\n\\n**RC2 (5-Whys):**\\n1. Agents guess `task:` instead of `id:`, `M` instead of `medium`, `6` instead of `1\u20135`\\n2. `CreatePlanConfig.tasks_yaml` description says only `\\\"YAML string with a 'tasks' key\\\"` \u2014 no enum values\\n3. Field description was not updated when parameter schema was formalised\\n4. No test verifies that the description is machine-parseable\\n5. Pydantic validation errors surface at call time, not at parameter construction time\\n\\n**RC3 (5-Whys):**\\n1. Skills/agents call non-existent tool names \u2192 `ToolError: tool not found`\\n2. Server refactor was done without a corresponding skills/agents sweep\\n3. No grep-based CI check enforces that `sam_create`/`sam_claim` references are absent\\n4. 15+ files across skills and agents directories retained old tool names\\n5. `tools:` frontmatter in agent files also lists deprecated names\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"8df8b215db932d415844235771fb0f37de410b23411aeaced6ffb6b242a2f7df\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCvXMQ\"}"}